## Decisions and Action Items

*   **Adoption Call**: The chairs will issue a formal working group adoption call on the mailing list for `draft-zollner-scim-group-membership`.
*   **Profile Review**: Volunteers (Ray, Stephen Hutchinson, Martin Sommer) will submit review feedback for `draft-zollner-scim-profile` to the mailing list.
*   **Charter PR Merges**: Chairs will merge non-contentious PRs into the draft charter repository.
*   **Charter Refinement**: Justin Richer and Danny Zollner will adjust the charter text regarding schematized data ingestion to prevent scope ambiguity.

